 the Safari extension menu to \naccess it.\n\n--\n\nReports and feedback are welcome at: \nneonoirapp@gmail.com\n\n--\n\nTHE FUTURE IS COLORFUL\n\nMore customized themes are coming soon,\nget ready to color all sites to your \nliking!\n\nThis optional extra is the only place where \nwe might charge a small fee and your kind \ncontribution will support the development of \nthis project. Half of all that income is going \nback to the Dark Reader community project.\n\nBEAUTIFUL NIGHT BROWSING STARTS HERE\n\nYou are more than welcome to keep using the app \nfor free forever!\n\nWhat are you waiting for? Your eyes are the \napples of your eyes!\n\nSee you on the other side.\n(I wonder which one that is... ;)", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.28, "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "5047296", "formattedPrice": "￦1,100", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 75, "trackContentRating": "4+", "releaseDate": "2021-11-01T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount": 75}]}